      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGVALE MARGI (8) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 4.5 lengths into second (19.94) at this track in a Grade 6 over 342m. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. ONCE A DIVA (4) box seated before sticking on well to finish 2.25 lengths away in third (19.89) at this track in a Grade 6 over 342m. Hard to beat again. ROYALE MAPLE (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (17.49) at Murray Bridge Straight last time. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has ability and is one of the better chances. WEBLEC BUBBLES (6) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
